teacher_info.about_teacher:
I’ve taught English, literature and writing in 3 U.S. universities and colleges, a language school in Moscow, and online. 

I’m patient, understanding, organized, and progress-oriented. I strive to create a relaxed learning environment which at the same time forces students to express themselves in new, varied, precise and sophisticated ways.

My teaching philosophy reflects what I myself seek as a language student, namely:

1. a caring and cheerful teacher who sincerely wants to help their students grow;
2. intellectually stimulating topics that generate meaningful discussion; 
3. ample speaking practice with a focus on language development, vocabulary enrichment, and grammatical accuracy.
